    "rich_text_b89MYR": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_yeFU9f": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is a Sensory Deprivation Tank?"
          }
        },
        "text_pRccyE": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>What is a Sensory Deprivation Tank? This specialized, lightproof, and soundproof environment is filled with 1,200 litres of pristine water and over 500kg of premium Epsom salts. This creates a hyper-buoyant space where you float effortlessly, regardless of your body type. However, not all sensory deprivation tanks in London are created equal.</p><p><a href=\"/pages/booking\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Booking\">Book your session today</a> to experience the ultimate London reset.</p><p>At Float Hub Shoreditch, we use world-class pods featuring:</p><ul><li><strong>Zero-Gravity Buoyancy:</strong> Achieving total spinal decompression and joint relief.</li><li><strong>Oversize: </strong>All of our pods are large enough for two, and the only pods in London you step (rather than crouch & clamber) into.</li><li><strong>Environmental Control:</strong> You have full control over the internal pod lighting. While we manage the high-fidelity audio system for you, we can select from a range of curated acoustic journeys – from meditative soundscapes to total silence – to suit your session goals.</li><li><strong>1.5 ATA Compatibility:</strong> We are the only Shoreditch centre offering synergistic recovery with our new <a href=\"/pages/hbot-london\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"HBOT London\">London Oxygen Suite.</a></li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "button_CWCY4h": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "button_label": "Book Your Session",
            "button_link": "shopify://pages/booking",
            "button_style_secondary": false,
