    "rich_text_gd49ny": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_RMqtX7": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to Prepare for Your First Float"
          }
        },
        "text_U3LRXe": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>To get the most out of your session, follow these 2026 “best practice” protocols:</p><ul><li><strong>Skip the Coffee:</strong> Avoid caffeine 3–4 hours before. You want your heart rate low to enter the Theta state quickly.</li><li><strong>Don’t Shave:</strong> Epsom salt is a natural mineral; it will sting fresh cuts or newly shaved skin!</li><li><strong>Eat Lightly:</strong> A heavy meal can make you hyper-aware of your digestion. A light snack 90 minutes before is ideal.</li><li><strong>Arrive Early:</strong> For your first visit, arrive 15 minutes early for a full tech walkthrough. For a more detailed breakdown of our costs and membership options, check our <a href=\"/pages/pricing\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Pricing\">Pricing Page.</a></li></ul>"
          }
        }
      },
